    "header": [
      {
        "name": "quest",
        "value": "R0C11Y26"
      },
      {
        "name": "displayname",
        "value": "The Mad Ripper"
      }
    ],
    "messages": [
      {
        "id": 1000,
        "firstLine": 13,
        "lines": [
          "<ce>                       %pcn, a madman they call",
          "<ce>                    the ____qgiver_ Ripper is terrorizing",
          "<ce>                 the city of ___qgiver_, and my guards",
          "<ce>              and constabulary are helpless against him.",
          "<ce>            They have no clues to his identity whatsoever.",
          "<ce>               I know you have some resources and rather",
          "<ce>                nontraditional contacts. Can you try and",
          "<ce>                 help me in this matter, for the good",
          "<ce>             of all ____qgiver_ -- and a substantial sum of gold?"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1001,
        "firstLine": 24,
        "lines": [
          "<ce>                 Not an uncommon response. Then I have",
          "<ce>                 little choice, but to call on some of",
          "<ce>                 my less-savoury contacts for help --",
          "<ce>                   an option I was hoping to avoid."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1002,
        "firstLine": 30,
        "lines": [
          "<ce>                     You are a true friend, %pcf.",
          "<ce>                    The people of ____qgiver_ are becoming",
          "<ce>               anxious about the lack of progress in the",
          "<ce>          official investigations. The situation is becoming",
          "<ce>                explosive, with people afraid that the",
          "<ce>            Ripper is coming for them next. I fear that we",
          "<ce>            will have a mob situation soon, perhaps within",
          "<ce>           =total_ days or less. The only other person I've",
          "<ce>               unofficially hired on this is _contact_,",
          "<ce>              a local scholar who has been analyzing some",
          "<ce>                 of the letters I've been sent. Go to",
          "<ce>                   _bookstore_ to talk to %g2 first,",
          "<ce>               and check on %g3 progress. If you cannnot",
          "<ce>              solve this mystery, then %god help us all."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1003,
        "firstLine": 46,
        "lines": [
          "<ce>                       The ____qgiver_ Ripper is still",
          "<ce>                at large. I have no time for chatting,",
          "<ce>                            nor should you."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1004,
        "firstLine": 51,
        "lines": [
          "<ce>                  ___qgiver_ is at peace again, %pcf,",
          "<ce>                  thanks to you. Here is the _reward_",
          "<ce>                    gold I promised -- gladly will",
          "<ce>                     I give it for the end of that",
          "<ce>                     maniac. %god truly blessed us",
          "<ce>                        when you came to ____qgiver_."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1005,
        "firstLine": 59,
        "lines": [
          "It isn't safe to walk the streets of ___qgiver_ anymore. Not with the ____qgiver_ Ripper.",
          "<--->",
          "I hear the ____qgiver_ Ripper isn't a man at all, but a daedra come to punish us all.",
          "<--->",
          "The last victim of the ____qgiver_ Ripper was found scattered in pieces over ___qgiver_.",
          "<--->",
          "Some folks are wondering if the ____qgiver_ Ripper might be a vampire or a werewolf."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1006,
        "firstLine": 68,
        "lines": [
          "The killings stopped without us needing a mob. Guess the Ripper moved on.",
          "<--->",
          "_qgiver_'s just lucky the ____qgiver_ Ripper decided to move on. Panic was setting in."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1007,
        "firstLine": 73,
        "lines": [
          "I can't believe _rippername_ was the ____qgiver_ Ripper -- %g was so nice and quiet.",
          "<--->",
          "%oth, they say they found a mountain of skulls buried under _rippername_'s house.",
          "<--->",
          "_rippername_, they say, was a loner who kept mostly to %g2-self. Typical."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1008,
        "firstLine": 80,
        "lines": [
          "I always have time for the %ra who solved the ____qgiver_ Ripper mystery, %pcf.",
          "<--->",
          "If it weren't for you, the ____qgiver_ Ripper would still terrorize us. What can I do?"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1009,
        "firstLine": 85,
        "lines": [
          "<ce>                     Lucky for you the ____qgiver_ Ripper",
          "<ce>                moved on. Otherwise, I'd be very angry",
          "<ce>                with you. In fact, I am angry with you.",
          "<ce>                            Sod off, %pcf."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1010,
        "firstLine": 91,
        "lines": [
          "<ce>                       Good timing, %pcf. I was",
          "<ce>                  about to go out to meet someone at",
          "<ce>                    _hookerhouse_ who might be able",
          "<ce>                 to shed some light on this situation.",
          "<ce>                      A =hooker_ named _hooker_.",
          "<ce>                 Quite frankly, a prostitute, but one",
          "<ce>                     whose name was scratched off",
          "<ce>                     the top of a letter _qgiver_",
          "<ce>                   received. Perhaps the Ripper was",
          "<ce>                     writing a letter to _hooker_,",
          "<ce>                   and then changed his mind. If so,",
          "<ce>                   %g might have some idea about the",
          "<ce>               Ripper's identity. It's worth a try. Why",
          "<ce>                     don't you go to _hookerhouse_",
          "<ce>                       with the letter and see?"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1011,
        "firstLine": 108,
        "lines": [
          "<ce>                          _qgiver_, the last",
          " one was So Tasty, I eveN toke a bite. Yor",
          " WHole family looks juicy too -- may be the",
          "<ce>                           Ripper will visit",
          " you nexxt. Ripping and rippng and tHen a",
          "<ce>                   litle RIPPING to setle the scoor.",
          "<ce>                            Gracishly yors,",
          " The ____qgiver_ Rippr"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1012,
        "firstLine": 118,
        "lines": [
          "_qgiver_,",
          "    catsh me if you CAN",
          " may be now you care abut your ____qgiver_",
          " now its soked in BLOOD",
          " Yor freind,",
          "<ce>                            The ____qgiver_ Rippr"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1013,
        "firstLine": 126,
        "lines": [
          "_contact_,",
          " ",
          "   I would be happy to meet with you,",
          " either at your place or mine about",
          " that barmy admirer of mine. I have",
          " a letter I was sent that might be",
          " helpful.",
          " ",
          "<ce>                         Yours truly, _hooker_"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1014,
        "firstLine": 137,
        "lines": [
          "_hooker_,",
          " ",
          " You said you would be my freind, but",
          " when I saw you on the street, you",
          " pretended you didn't see me.",
          " ",
          " You don't want to make me angry",
          " again, do you",
          " ",
          " _rippername_"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1015,
        "firstLine": 149,
        "lines": [
          "<ce>                      You work with _contact_, do",
          "<ce>                        you, %pcf? Well, %g was",
          "<ce>               interested in this letter I was sent the",
          "<ce>                     other night. _rippername_ was",
          "<ce>               a client of mine, with some real tetched",
          "<ce>                ideas of a good time. Some real tetched",
          "<ce>               ideas in general. I kinda felt sorry for",
          "<ce>                 %g2, mostly I was afraid of %g2 so I",
          "<ce>              guess I let %g2 think I liked %g2. 'Course",
          "<ce>              now I'm getting letters like this. I think",
          "<ce>                   %g very much could be the ____qgiver_",
          "<ce>                 Ripper. He lives at _ripperhouse_ if",
          "<ce>                 you want to go see %g2 for real life."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1016,
        "firstLine": 164,
        "lines": [
          "_hooker_ is a common prostitute. Just %di of here if you're interested.",
          "<--->",
          "Nothing more than a cheap prostitute, _hooker_ is. %di if you're looking."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1017,
        "firstLine": 169,
        "lines": [
          "_hooker_ used to hang around with a character called _rippername_. Spooky one.",
          "<--->",
          "_hooker_ knows all about Rippers. Ask %g3 about _rippername_ -- nasty creep."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1020,
        "firstLine": 174,
        "lines": [
          "%qdat:",
          " I have arrived in ___qgiver_",
          " and met with _qgiver_ about",
          " the mystery of the ____qgiver_ Ripper.",
          " %G wants the Ripper caught in =total_",
          " days before all ___qgiver_ turns into an",
          " angry mob. My only lead is a scholar named",
          " _contact_ who has the letters",
          " the Ripper sent _qgiver_.",
          " _contact_ is working out of",
          " _bookstore_."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1021,
        "firstLine": 187,
        "lines": [
          "%qdat:",
          " _contact_ has sent me",
          " to _hookerhouse_ to meet with",
          " a prostitute named _hooker_,",
          " who might have some information about the Ripper."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1022,
        "firstLine": 194,
        "lines": [
          "%qdat:",
          " The ____qgiver_ Ripper had a meeting",
          " with _contact_ before I got there.",
          " One of the letters I found",
          " in __contact_ was from someone",
          " named _hooker_ who wanted to",
          " meet with _contact_ about a",
          " 'barmy admirer.' That's who I have to find next.",
          " And this time, I'll need to be there earlier."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1023,
        "firstLine": 205,
        "lines": [
          "%qdat:",
          " _hooker_ told me about",
          " a client %g had, crazy enough to be the Ripper.",
          " Someone named _rippername_, who lives",
          " at _ripperhouse_. I hope this won't",
          " be the last log I ever write."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1024,
        "firstLine": 213,
        "lines": [
          "%qdat:",
          " _hooker_'s admirer apparently",
          " came calling before I did. In %g2",
          " house I did find a letter from someone named",
          " _rippername_. Sounded skittish",
          " enough to be our Ripper. Worth investigating,",
          " anyhow."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1025,
        "firstLine": 222,
        "lines": [
          "_contact_ is quite a learned scholar over in _bookstore_, %di of here.",
          "<--->",
          "_contact_ is sometimes _qgiver_'s tutor on certain matters of the human mind."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1026,
        "firstLine": 227,
        "lines": [
          "_contact_ is an old fool who's going to get in trouble one day pursuing the Ripper.",
          "<--->",
          "_contact_'s a sage at _bookstore_, dangerously involved in the Ripper business."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1040,
        "firstLine": 232,
        "lines": [
          "_rippername_?  You'll probably find %g2 over at _ripperhouse_.",
          "<--->",
          "Don't know much about _rippername_. Keeps to himself mostly.",
          "<--->",
          "_rippername_ is that nice young man who lives in _ripperhouse_."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1041,
        "firstLine": 239,
        "lines": [
          "<ce> Well, he seems normal enough, but I've heard a few stories about him",
          "<ce>                 that might make you think otherwise.",
          "                                     <--->",
          "<ce>He's nice, but a little weird, you know?  Makes you wonder sometimes if",
          "<ce>                    he's playing with a full deck."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 1050,
        "firstLine": 246,
        "lines": [
          "<ce>            I seen you with my girlfriend!  Now you and she",
          "<ce>             are gonna get Ripped together since you like",
          "<ce>                          each other so much!"
        ]
      }
